meta {
  name: Get Public Job
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/public/jobs/{{job_id}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  ## Get Single Published Job

  Returns one published job posting by ID. No authentication required.

  Returns **404** if the job does not exist or is not in `published` status.
  Draft and closed jobs are intentionally hidden.

  ### Path Parameter
  | Param  | Description            |
  |--------|------------------------|
  | job_id | UUID of the job posting |

  ### Response fields (applicant-safe)
  `id` · `title` · `description` · `location` · `deadline` · `posted_at`
}
